folio8 redistributes the local PDF.js worker, four Adobe binary CMaps, and four
Liberation Sans standard-font files from pdfjs-dist to rasterize PDF bytes
produced by folio8's local Go renderer. No PDF.js viewer asset is served from a
network origin.

folio8 also redistributes two PDF.js SOURCE files, copied from the mozilla/pdf.js
repository at tag v6.2.108 (the same version as the pdfjs-dist package above) and
carried in folio-designer/src/vendor/pdfjs/:

- web/pdf_thumbnail_view.js — modified in three recorded places so it resolves
  its two imports from pdfjs-dist/build/pdf.mjs and needs no viewer AppOptions.
- web/renderable_view.js — unmodified, byte for byte.

Both keep their Apache-2.0 headers intact. Every change, with its reason and the
SHA-256 of each file before and after, is recorded in
folio-designer/src/vendor/pdfjs/PROVENANCE.md.

